    "title": "New court docs reveal possible second suspect in death of Reading family - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shaira Arias ,\n1 hours ago New court documents on Wednesday revealed more information into the case of a Reading couple and their youngest child found dead in separate locations in Berks County. Junior Cabrera-Colon, 31, Geraldina Peguero-Mancebo, and their 1-year-old son, Jeydon Junior Peguero, were all found dead after being reported missing on Sept. 12, 2025. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
